      <div class="text-lead d-block col-lg-11">
                  <i class="text-lead--changed">
            Last update: 8 October 2026          </i>
        
                  <p>Do you have the nationality of a country of the EU, EEA or Switzerland? Then you do not need a residence permit to stay in the Netherlands. Sometimes you do have to register with the IND. Read when you should register with the IND and how you do this.</p>
              </div>
